$\begin{align}
h'(x)&=\dfrac{d}{dx}\left[ \dfrac{4x^2}{x^2-1} \right]
\\\\
&=\dfrac{(x^2-1)\cdot \dfrac{d}{dx}[4x^2]-4x^2\cdot \dfrac{d}{dx}[x^2-1]}{(x^2-1)^2}
\\\\
&=\dfrac{(x^2-1)\cdot 8x-4x^2\cdot 2x}{(x^2-1)^2}
\\\\
&=\dfrac{-8x}{(x^2-1)^2}
\end{align}$

Now let's look for $x$-values where $h'$ is zero or undefined.
